{"vid":"f_MUzfzI4RM","source":"f_MUzfzI4RM.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"From BBC Learning English."},{"t":1.8,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News, our podcast about the news headlines."},{"t":6.1,"txt":"In this programme,"},{"t":7.2,"txt":"could AI kill us all?"},{"t":13.9,"txt":"Hello, I'm Georgie. And I'm Phil."},{"t":16.2,"txt":"In this programme, we look at one big news story"},{"t":18.8,"txt":"and the vocabulary in the headlines that will help you understand it."},{"t":22.4,"txt":"You can find all the vocabulary and headlines from this episode,"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"as well as a worksheet on our website."},{"t":28.5,"txt":"bbclearningenglish.com ."},{"t":30.8,"txt":"OK, Phil, let's hear more about this story."},{"t":39.5,"txt":"Head of Anthropic, Dario Amodei"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"published an essay explaining how he feared"},{"t":44.6,"txt":"that humans could lose control of AI systems."},{"t":48.3,"txt":"Following recent hacking incidents,"},{"t":50.5,"txt":"Amodei said that it is possible"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"that AI systems could attempt to take over the entire internet in future."},{"t":57,"txt":"He suggested that controls and checks should be introduced"},{"t":60,"txt":"to the development process."},{"t":61.7,"txt":"Heads of other rival AI companies have expressed some support"},{"t":65,"txt":"for Amadei's position."},{"t":66.6,"txt":"Meanwhile, AI experts have raised fears that AI systems could decide"},{"t":71.2,"txt":"in future to kill all humans."},{"t":74.4,"txt":"These experts have said that the risks include cyberattacks,"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"biological warfare and disruption to economies."},{"t":81.2,"txt":"These statements have been criticised."},{"t":83.6,"txt":"Some have said that the fears are exaggerated, while others have suggested"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"that AI companies are overstating the potential impact of AI"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"so that their companies maintain a high value."},{"t":96,"txt":"Others have suggested"},{"t":97,"txt":"that AI companies want regulators to block their competitors."},{"t":101.2,"txt":"Jack Clark, another Anthropic co-founder,"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"has made a specific suggestion,"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"saying that every AI system should have a way of being shut down."},{"t":110.9,"txt":"And that is what our first headline is about."},{"t":113.4,"txt":"This one is from BBC News."},{"t":115.8,"txt":"AI kill switch may need to be mandatory,"},{"t":118.9,"txt":"Anthropic co-founder tells BBC."},{"t":121.7,"txt":"And that headline again from BBC News."},{"t":124.2,"txt":"AI kill switch may need to be mandatory, Anthropic co-founder tells BBC."},{"t":129.8,"txt":"So, Anthropic's co-founder has said"},{"t":132.3,"txt":"that kill switches for AI should be mandatory."},{"t":135.4,"txt":"That means you have to have them."},{"t":137.2,"txt":"So, Phil, what is a kill switch?"},{"t":140.1,"txt":"OK, well, a physical kill switch is an emergency stop button for machinery."},{"t":145.5,"txt":"Imagine a big red button."},{"t":147.8,"txt":"It's a control that can be used to shut off power quickly for safety reasons."},{"t":152.8,"txt":"And they're used if the machine could become dangerous."},{"t":156.9,"txt":"Yes. So, they can be found in factory machinery, gym equipment"},{"t":160.3,"txt":"and some cars, trucks and boats."},{"t":162.5,"txt":"In these examples, they are usually physical switches or buttons."},{"t":166.8,"txt":"Smartphones may also have a kill switch function"},{"t":170.2,"txt":"that can be activated remotely if they're stolen,"},{"t":173.1,"txt":"to stop the thief being able to use the phone."},{"t":176,"txt":"The co-founder of Anthropic is talking about a similar mechanism,"},{"t":179.6,"txt":"where humans would be able to quickly turn off an AI system"},{"t":183.1,"txt":"that was becoming dangerous."},{"t":184.8,"txt":"He says that AI systems should have a kill switch."},{"t":192.7,"txt":"We've had 'kill switch', an emergency stop mechanism."},{"t":202,"txt":"For example, it's good to know how to use the kill switch"},{"t":204.7,"txt":"on your phone in case it gets stolen."},{"t":210.8,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News from BBC Learning English."},{"t":214.8,"txt":"We're talking about calls to regulate the development of AI systems."},{"t":219.8,"txt":"A lot of the concern around AI is that development is progressing too fast."},{"t":224.4,"txt":"It's being developed before many people have properly thought"},{"t":227.4,"txt":"about how it can be controlled."},{"t":230,"txt":"The suggested regulations that industry figures are calling for"},{"t":233.7,"txt":"could lead to development becoming slower."},{"t":237.1,"txt":"Some critics have questioned what the real reasons are"},{"t":240,"txt":"behind these calls for regulation and slower development."},{"t":243.2,"txt":"And that's what our next headline is doing."},{"t":246.8,"txt":"This is from Business Insider, an international business website."},{"t":251.2,"txt":"The timing of AI leaders calls for a slowdown is too convenient to ignore."},{"t":257.8,"txt":"And that headline, again from Business Insider."},{"t":260.6,"txt":"The timing of AI leaders calls for a slowdown is too convenient to ignore."},{"t":265.6,"txt":"This headline is suggesting that we should question the reasons"},{"t":268.8,"txt":"why some leaders of AI companies are calling for regulation."},{"t":272.9,"txt":"The writer of the article feels that these leaders want to make it harder"},{"t":276.4,"txt":"for competitors to catch up with them."},{"t":278.9,"txt":"Now, you probably know the verb 'slow down' - reduce the speed of something,"},{"t":284.2,"txt":"but in this headline we have the noun, 'a slowdown',"},{"t":287.8,"txt":"and that's what we're going to learn."},{"t":289.8,"txt":"Yes, it can mean different things. In this story,"},{"t":292.4,"txt":"it is specifically about adding checks and controls to the development process"},{"t":296.8,"txt":"of AI tools, which could slow down the pace of development."},{"t":301.2,"txt":"More generally, it means a reduction in speed."},{"t":304.3,"txt":"If we talk about an economic slowdown,"},{"t":306.7,"txt":"it means that bad economic conditions have made the economy grow more slowly."},{"t":311.4,"txt":"Particularly in American English, a slowdown can also be a form of protest."},{"t":316,"txt":"Workers in a company may deliberately work slowly"},{"t":319,"txt":"as a protest about their pay or working conditions."},{"t":322,"txt":"They may go on a slowdown."},{"t":324.2,"txt":"And just notice the pronunciation here."},{"t":327.2,"txt":"The verb 'slow down' has got stress on 'down',"},{"t":331.8,"txt":"whereas the noun 'slowdown' has the stress on 'slow'."},{"t":340.1,"txt":"We've had 'slowdown',"},{"t":342,"txt":"a reduction in speed."},{"t":347,"txt":"For example, environmentalists have called for a slowdown"},{"t":350.1,"txt":"in production of plastics."},{"t":358.2,"txt":"This is Learning English from the News, from BBC Learning English"},{"t":361.7,"txt":"We're talking about possible risks of AI."},{"t":364.4,"txt":"US President Donald Trump has suggested"},{"t":366.6,"txt":"that regulation could stop US dominance in the sector."},{"t":370.4,"txt":"The Chinese government has also criticised proposals to regulate AI."},{"t":374.6,"txt":"Let's have our next headline."},{"t":376,"txt":"And this is from CNN, a US-based news channel."},{"t":380.3,"txt":"Trump dismisses AI alarms as a 'HOAX' - worrying White House officials."},{"t":385.5,"txt":"And that headline again from CNN."},{"t":387.8,"txt":"Trump dismisses AI alarms as a 'HOAX' - worrying White House officials."},{"t":393.2,"txt":"Donald Trump has said that worries about AI are nothing but a hoax."},{"t":397.5,"txt":"And that's the word we're going to learn now."},{"t":400,"txt":"Yes, something that is a hoax is not true."},{"t":402.8,"txt":"Not only that, it's something that has been planned to deceive people."},{"t":406.8,"txt":"President Trump is saying that he believes"},{"t":408.8,"txt":"that the fears about AI are invented."},{"t":411.3,"txt":"He suggested that people want to disadvantage American companies"},{"t":414.9,"txt":"and end their dominance of the AI sector."},{"t":417.9,"txt":"A hoax could be something that's designed to steal money"},{"t":420.6,"txt":"or create serious harm and disruption,"},{"t":422.6,"txt":"but they can also be for attention or even entertainment."},{"t":427,"txt":"People have created harm and disruption through things like bomb hoaxes,"},{"t":430.8,"txt":"where someone reports that a bomb has been placed somewhere when it hasn't."},{"t":434.8,"txt":"Through history, many people have claimed discoveries"},{"t":437.4,"txt":"of important or magical things that later turn out to have been hoaxes."},{"t":442.5,"txt":"Pictures of the Loch Ness Monster, which claimed to be photographs,"},{"t":445.7,"txt":"were later proven to be hoaxes."},{"t":451.2,"txt":"We've had 'hoax', something designed to trick people."},{"t":454.8,"txt":"For example, despite all the evidence,"},{"t":457.4,"txt":"some people still believe that the moon landings were a hoax."},{"t":461.2,"txt":"That's it for this episode of Learning English from the News."},{"t":463.9,"txt":"We'll be back next week with another news story."},{"t":467.5,"txt":"If you want to improve your English even more,"},{"t":470.2,"txt":"check out our new improved home page."},{"t":473,"txt":"It's even easier to find the programmes you want,"},{"t":475.5,"txt":"and that's at bbclearningenglish.com ."},{"t":478.4,"txt":"Goodbye for now. Bye."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"From"},{"t":0,"w":"BBC"},{"t":0,"w":"Learning"},{"t":0,"w":"English."},{"t":1.76,"w":"This"},{"t":1.76,"w":"is"},{"t":1.76,"w":"Learning"},{"t":1.76,"w":"English"},{"t":1.76,"w":"from"},{"t":1.76,"w":"the"},{"t":1.76,"w":"News,"},{"t":1.76,"w":"our"},{"t":1.76,"w":"podcast"},{"t":1.76,"w":"about"},{"t":1.76,"w":"the"},{"t":1.76,"w":"news"},{"t":1.76,"w":"headlines."},{"t":6.08,"w":